    "result_text": "The test passes. Let me summarize what I implemented.\n\nThe change adds a **Dashboard home screen** as a full-stack, additive feature:\n\n- **Server endpoint** \u2014 `src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/dashboard.GET.yml` + `GetDashboard.java` (new `dashboard` package). It uses `JdbcTemplate` to count clients, count projects, and sum the amount of all `UNPAID` invoices (`COALESCE(SUM(...), 0)`), returning a `DashboardView`.\n- **Front-end** \u2014 `src/main/frontend/features/dashboard/feature.tsx`, a new feature file that registers itself via the manifest router (no edit to shared router). It fetches `/api/dashboard` and renders the counts and the outstanding total, formatted to two decimals via `toFixed(2)`.\n\nIt matches the spec's anchors exactly: `nav-dashboard`, `dashboard-clients-count` (`2`), `dashboard-projects-count` (`2`), and `dashboard-outstanding-total` (`300.00`).\n\nNo schema migration was needed \u2014 all three tables (`clients`, `projects`, `invoices` with `status`) already exist, and the feature is purely read-only over them. The spec expects no audit records, so none are emitted. `bin/e2e` passes.",
